###
# Schedule Generation API Tests
# Test file for all schedule generation endpoints
# Use with REST Client extension in VS Code or similar HTTP client
###

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@tenantId = 6eb9c106-b650-4398-b6fa-091b6828c4ba
@testClassId = {{$guid}}
@testCourseId = {{$guid}}
@testTimeSlotId = {{$guid}}

### 1. Create Time Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Lundi Matin Test",
  "dayOfWeek": "monday",
  "startTime": "08:00:00",
  "endTime": "10:00:00",
  "isActive": true,
  "priority": 3,
  "maxConcurrentSessions": 1
}

### 2. List Time Slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 3. List Time Slots with Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots?dayOfWeek=monday&isActive=true
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 4. Create Another Time Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Mardi Après-midi Test",
  "dayOfWeek": "tuesday",
  "startTime": "14:00:00",
  "endTime": "16:00:00",
  "isActive": true,
  "priority": 2,
  "maxConcurrentSessions": 2
}

### 5. Get Generation Options for Class
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/classes/{{testClassId}}/generation-options
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 6. Generate Schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "classId": "{{testClassId}}",
  "selectedCourses": [
    {
      "courseId": "{{testCourseId}}",
      "requiredHours": 20,
      "preferredSessionDuration": 120,
      "maxSessionsPerWeek": 2
    }
  ],
  "availableTimeSlots": [
    "{{testTimeSlotId}}"
  ],
  "generationPreferences": {
    "balanceWorkload": true,
    "avoidBackToBackSessions": false,
    "preferMorningSlots": true,
    "maxDailyHours": 6,
    "allowWeekendSessions": false
  }
}

### 7. Get Generation Status
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/{{$guid}}/status
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 8. Get Generation Result
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/{{$guid}}/result
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 9. Approve Schedule
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/{{$guid}}/approve
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "startDate": "2024-09-01",
  "endDate": "2024-12-31"
}

### 10. List Generation Requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/requests
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 11. List Generation Requests with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/requests?status=completed&limit=10&offset=0
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 12. Test Error Cases - Invalid Time Slot
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "name": "Invalid Time Slot",
  "dayOfWeek": "monday",
  "startTime": "10:00:00",
  "endTime": "08:00:00"
}

### 13. Test Error Cases - Missing Required Fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

{
  "classId": "{{testClassId}}"
}

### 14. Test Error Cases - Invalid Class ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/classes/invalid-uuid/generation-options
x-tenant: {{tenantId}}

### 15. Test Error Cases - Missing Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots

### 16. Performance Test - Multiple Time Slots Creation
POST {{baseUrl}}/schedule-generation/time-slots
Content-Type: application/json
